{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788809556527168001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"idling-amaranth-antelope","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"e5362bfab148d32f5f5415859a7e4f3cba0395997d1dd3af01b33328510a0b84","event_uuid":"70548e30-b620-4a9e-8479-7827b8edf18c","position":{"commit_sha":"b30e77e8350396e1167d53c830324c96f7c10ee6","position":"1788806443045238480-70548e30-b620-4a9e-8479-7827b8edf18c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"db932373d0364c77180559dfbcada526ac44d1d7251824535e649af00c5becd2","event_uuid":"6515055c-320b-4f7a-97d1-dbe47215e24c","position":{"commit_sha":"e3ae5df86b8651dc8873229f4e677e095f861544","position":"1788806453084391478-6515055c-320b-4f7a-97d1-dbe47215e24c"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"060b3a67da92cda1de1095daa55a101220204f928203ef3234aa33abcf5f60e6","event_uuid":"744fa28b-0c22-48ae-8ab5-511f68d50a43","position":{"commit_sha":"0c66082c6c7bf003751cb82dc2b35b07b1f807e0","position":"1788806455832013188-744fa28b-0c22-48ae-8ab5-511f68d50a43"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788806443045238480,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"6515055c-320b-4f7a-97d1-dbe47215e24c","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"3e7a-d8ef-ce56-4eb7"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nNothing prevents a future doc or script from re-teaching a removed verb, and nothing asserts that the hint registry's replacements are themselves live commands. Cites are on origin/main 2e81cb9767c1.\n\n## Approach\nNew `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_removed_cli_verbs_heldout.py` modelled on `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_bridge_vocabulary_stale_heldout.py:25-66`: (a) for every key in `_help_route._REMOVED_SPELLINGS`: `route_for(key) is None`; `main([key])` exits 2 and stderr has `invalid choice`, the key, and the hint; the hint's first token after `rebar ` is a live top-level route (and for `store ...` a member of `STORE_ROUTES`); (b) a `git ls-files` scan of `docs/ AGENTS.md CONTRIBUTING.md README.md templates/ examples/ src/rebar/_guides/ scripts/ .github/` for `rebar <old>` with the frozen-history prefixes excluded and a whole-file allowlist (`docs/release-notes.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, `docs/exit-codes.md`, `docs/adr/`, `src/rebar/_cli/_help_route.py`, this test). Extend `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_help_overview_coverage.py` to assert no `help/<old>.txt` artifact survives.\n\n## Scope\n`tests/interfaces/contracts/test_removed_cli_verbs_heldout.py` (new), `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_help_overview_coverage.py`. Out of scope: all source and docs.\n\n## Testing\nThe test fails when run against the store-group story's tree with the docs story reverted (proving it bites) and passes on the docs story's tree; `make verify`.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The test is parametrized over the dict with no hard-coded copy of the list.\n- [ ] The scan is proven red-then-green as above (the commit message records both runs).\n- [ ] The test runs in the `ubuntu-latest, py3.13` selection (`not integration and not external`) with no marker beyond the contracts tier.\n- [ ] `make verify` exits 0.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_removed_cli_verbs_heldout.py","reason":"new held-out test"},{"path":"tests/interfaces/contracts/test_help_overview_coverage.py","reason":"no stale help artifacts"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["depends_on","3e7a-d8ef-ce56-4eb7"],["parent","e045-84a5-e545-4f46"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"e045-84a5-e545-4f46","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["complexity-reduction","breaking-pass-4"],"ticket_id":"2183-fa68-d48f-42fe","ticket_type":"story","title":"Held-out test: removed CLI spellings never return to a teaching surface and every hint names a live command","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["70548e30-b620-4a9e-8479-7827b8edf18c","6515055c-320b-4f7a-97d1-dbe47215e24c","744fa28b-0c22-48ae-8ab5-511f68d50a43"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788809556527168001,"uuid":"899d51c2-ef3a-4f5e-a519-ff41ddf73af4"}